---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../utils/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Cozy Tiny Space — what data this site collects, cookies, analytics, advertising and affiliate links."
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy-policy/' },
  ]}
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-4 pt-10">
    <h1 class="font-display text-[clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem)] font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-[0.9rem] text-muted">Last updated: November 19, 2026</p>
    <div class="article-body mt-6">
      <p>
        Cozy Tiny Space ("we", "us", "our") is a content website about
        renter-friendly storage and organization. This policy explains what
        information we collect and how we use it.
      </p>
      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        This site does not run user accounts and does not ask you to register.
        The only personal information you may give us directly is your email
        address and message if you contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}> {SITE.email}</a>. We use it only to
        reply to you. We do not sell, rent or share your email address.
      </p>
      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        This site itself sets no tracking cookies. The newsletter form, if you
        use it, is handled by our email provider once connected; that provider
        may set its own cookies under its own policy. Advertising and analytics
        providers, when added, may use cookies as described below.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use privacy-friendly analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics and/or
        Google Analytics) to understand which guides readers find useful. These
        tools collect aggregated, anonymized usage data such as pages visited,
        approximate location and device type. They do not identify you personally.
      </p>
      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site currently shows no advertisements. When display advertising is
        added (Google AdSense first, then a premium network), the ad provider
        and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your visits to
        this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising at
        any time through your browser settings or the provider's opt-out pages.
        This policy will be updated when advertising goes live.
      </p>
      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        This site currently contains no affiliate links. If affiliate links are
        added in the future, they will be clearly identified and this policy and
        the <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a> will be
        updated first.
      </p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        Our articles link to third-party websites (retailers, publishers and
        manufacturers). We are not responsible for their privacy practices.
        Please read their policies when you visit them.
      </p>
      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>
        This site is intended for adults. We do not knowingly collect personal
        information from children under 13.
      </p>
      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy when the site changes — for example when
        advertising or affiliate links are added. The "Last updated" date above
        will change, and material changes will be noted here.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
